firebase-ios-sdk (https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk)
Copyright Google LLC
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
sdk/ios/firebase-storage-patch/storage-host.patch modifies FirebaseStorage
(FirebaseStorage/Sources/Storage.swift, Internal/StorageUtils.swift,
Internal/StorageGetDownloadURLTask.swift and Internal/StorageFetcherService.swift,
and adds Internal/ArumaStorageOrigin.swift and a unit test) so that it reads
its server from ArumaURL in the app's Info.plist, and makes its port optional;
nothing else is changed. make-mirror.sh builds the patched release as a
SwiftPM mirror whose every commit carries ARUMA-NOTICE.md
(sdk/ios/firebase-storage-patch/MIRROR-NOTICE.md), and
sdk/ios/ArumaRedirect/Scripts/aruma_storage.rb applies the same patch to the
FirebaseStorage pod of a CocoaPods app. Each modified file states the change
in its header. No firebase-ios-sdk code is included in this repository other
than the context lines of the patch.
